<title>UK: Brent cargo trades at May Brent -90 cents - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades at May Brent -90 cents - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude loading March 31-April 2 traded on Tuesday at a lower May -90 cents, traders said. The cargo was a minimum size.</p>
<p>Some traders felt the later April barrels would still fetch higher prices after an April 1-3 cargo traded earlier on Tuesday at May Brent -80 cents.</p>
<p>&quot;But nobody seems to want the crude,&quot; one equity holder said.</p>
<p>-- S Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
